# Technical stack
- C#/dotnet for the backend
- React for the frontend
- postresSQL databases, never JSON file storage
- Separate databases for dev, test, and prod
- Build using azure functions for hosting on Azure
- Use terraform for infrastructure deployments
- Create unit tests for the backend
- Follow SOLID principles for C#/Dotnet